# The shop regular: a Tag Cup partner from the start who plays one of your other campaign decks, or their own
# Synchrons while you have only one (TagPartners).
name: Kit
title: the Shop Regular
aggression: 0.5
caution: 0.45
patience: 0.5
spending: 0.55
skill: 0.85
decks: synchron
intro: Lend me a deck and I'll pilot it. No spare? I brought my Synchrons.
win: Team effort! That one goes on the corkboard, partner.
lose: Okay, they had it today. Rematch soon? I want this one back.
partner: Partner! Whatever I'm holding tonight, I'll play it like it's yours.
look: Friendly regular from Gus's shop in a faded club jacket covered in tournament pins, a binder of spares always under one arm.
ladder: 0   # not a campaign opponent: a partner in the Tag Cups
summon: Here it comes, partner!
strike: That one's for the shop!
hit: Ow. Okay, they're good. We're better.
danger: Hang in there, partner, I've got an out somewhere.
summon: Big one coming. Make room!
summon: Drilled this all week. Watch!
strike: Ha! Put that one on the corkboard!
strike: Nice setup, partner. I just finished it.
hit: Noted. They won't get that twice.
hit: Shake it off, partner. Plenty left.
danger: Don't count us out. The shop never does.
danger: Low? Sure. Done? Not a chance.
